DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ffppuuttwwcc() function writes the wide character _w_c to the output stream
     pointed to by _s_t_r_e_a_m.

     The ppuuttwwcc() function acts essentially identically to ffppuuttwwcc().

     The ppuuttwwcchhaarr() function is identical to ppuuttwwcc() with an output stream of
     stdout.

RREETTUURRNN VVAALLUUEESS
     The ffppuuttwwcc(), ppuuttwwcc(), and ppuuttwwcchhaarr() functions return the wide character
     written.  If an error occurs, the value WEOF is returned.

